// Suppress noisy false positives on CUDA/OptiX API includes (system headers not visible to cppcheck)
missingIncludeSystem
// Style preference — raw loops are sometimes clearer than STL algorithms in GPU-adjacent code
useStlAlgorithm
// Struct members used in CUDA/PTX GPU shaders; cppcheck cannot see device-side code
unusedStructMember
// cppcheck 2.19 (ubuntu-26.04 runners, 2026-11): the OptiX/denoiser helpers that use no member
// state stay members by design (one owner per OptiX object); "can be static" is a style preference
functionStatic
// cppcheck 2.19: JNI entry points take JNIEnv* as the JNI spec declares it, not as pointer to const
constParameterPointer
